## Cloud Agent Configuration

### Model Selection

```yaml
workflow:
  model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514"
```

### Agent Options

```yaml
workflow:
  agentOptions:
    skipInstall: false    # Skip npm install during automation run
    memoryEnabled: true   # Enable agent memory across runs
```

### Full Automation Example

```yaml
name: "PR Security Review"
description: "Automatically review PRs for security issues and post findings"
workflow:
  triggers:
    - git:
        pullRequest:
          repos:
            - myorg/myrepo
          action: OPENED
  gitConfig:
    repo: myorg/myrepo
    branch: main
  actions:
    - prComment:
        action: COMMENTED
    - slack:
        channel: "C0REVIEW"
  prompts:
    - |
      Review this pull request for security issues.
      Check for:
      - SQL injection vectors
      - Unvalidated redirects
      - Hardcoded secrets
      - Missing auth checks
      
      Post findings as a PR comment and summary to Slack.
  model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514"
  agentOptions:
    skipInstall: false
  memoryEnabled: true
```

