## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Automation won't save with MCP | MCP server not dashboard-eligible | Use only servers with `dashboard-`, `dashboard-team-`, or `plugin-` prefix |
| MCP auth fails in editor | Server unauthenticated | Authenticate MCP in chat before prefilling |
| Slack channel not found | Used user ID instead of channel ID | Ensure Slack IDs are `C…`, `G…`, or `D…` format |
| Cron trigger not firing | Invalid cron expression | Use standard 5-field cron format: `min hour day month weekday` |
| Git trigger wrong repo | `gitConfig` scope mismatch | Ensure `gitConfig.repo` matches the trigger's PR scope |
| Draft table blocked | Unresolved PCD gates | Resolve all PCD gates or explicitly defer to editor |

